---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Our Story"
  description="Founded by Daniela and Scarlett, Soraya Rose Studio brings together luxury interior design and property development expertise.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 pb-14 pt-20 text-center lg:pb-20 lg:pt-28">
    <p class="eyebrow text-taupe">Our Story</p>
    <h1 class="mt-5 font-display text-5xl font-light leading-[1.05] lg:text-7xl">Two creative minds.<br><em>One shared vision.</em></h1>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/70">Soraya Rose Studio was born from a shared passion between two friends for beautiful interiors, timeless design and the belief that every space should tell a story.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 lg:px-10">
    <div class="photo aspect-[4/3] sm:aspect-[16/9]" style="--img:url('/images/founders.jpg')" role="img" aria-label="Daniela and Scarlett, founders of Soraya Rose Studio"></div>
  </div>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20 text-center lg:py-24">
    <p class="font-display text-2xl font-light leading-relaxed lg:text-3xl">Founded by Daniela and Scarlett, the studio brings together two distinct yet perfectly complementary backgrounds, united by a love of thoughtful design, exceptional craftsmanship and the finer details that make a house feel like a home.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-sand">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-16 px-6 py-20 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-24 lg:px-10 lg:py-28">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow text-taupe">Co-founder</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-5xl font-light">Daniela</h2>
        <span class="my-6 block h-px w-16 bg-ink/30"></span>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-ink/75">With a degree in Architectural Interior Design from London&rsquo;s prestigious Inchbald School of Design, Daniela began her career at the renowned Conran &amp; Partners, spending four years within its luxury interior design team. Working across high-end residential and hospitality projects, she developed a refined design sensibility, an appreciation for beautiful materials and an instinct for creating spaces that feel both sophisticated and inviting.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow text-taupe">Co-founder</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-5xl font-light">Scarlett</h2>
        <span class="my-6 block h-px w-16 bg-ink/30"></span>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-ink/75">Scarlett&rsquo;s journey into interiors began through the world of luxury property development. Through her work with Rosewood Luxury Developments, she gained extensive hands-on experience in transforming architectural visions into exceptional homes. From planning and building regulations to interior design and project management, her understanding of the entire development process brings an invaluable practical perspective to the studio.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-6 px-6 py-20 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/80 lg:py-28">
    <p>It was their shared appreciation for understated luxury, considered details and beautifully balanced interiors that brought Soraya Rose Studio to life.</p>
    <p>Together, Daniela and Scarlett offer something truly special: the creativity and vision of a luxury design studio, combined with the technical knowledge and experience required to bring even the most ambitious projects to fruition.</p>
    <p>Their approach is personal, collaborative and entirely bespoke. They believe that the most beautiful spaces are those that reflect the people who live within them, where elegance meets comfort and every detail has been thoughtfully considered.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-sand">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="photo min-h-[380px] lg:min-h-[560px]" style="--img:url('/images/story-detail.jpg')" role="img" aria-label="A beautifully finished interior detail"></div>
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-center px-6 py-16 lg:px-20">
        <p class="eyebrow text-taupe">A fully managed experience</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl font-light leading-tight lg:text-5xl">From first sketch to <em>final flourish</em></h2>
        <span class="my-8 block h-px w-16 bg-ink/30"></span>
        <div class="space-y-5 leading-relaxed text-ink/75">
          <p>From the earliest sketches and concepts to the final finishing touches, Soraya Rose Studio provides a seamless, fully managed interior design experience, allowing clients to enjoy the creative journey with confidence.</p>
          <p>Working predominantly across London and the Home Counties, with select projects further afield and internationally, the studio specialises in creating timeless, luxurious interiors that feel effortlessly elegant, deeply personal and designed to be enjoyed for years to come.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-10"><a href="/services/" class="btn">How we work <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
